14:32.972 --> 14:36.033
And so the next and final step in your system, and I

14:36.033 --> 14:37.923
know this has been a lot, so

14:37.923 --> 14:40.082
just stick with me here. We're almost there.

14:40.082 --> 14:45.863
What you're going to do here is to define a generate_structured_support_ticket function

14:45.863 --> 14:48.212
that takes in your customer_query,

14:48.212 --> 14:52.033
the message that was the response from the previous LLM call,

14:52.033 --> 14:54.763
