15:38.854 --> 15:41.083
And construct a prompt that says you're a support agent,

15:41.303 --> 15:43.441
use all the information below to generate

15:43.441 --> 15:45.884
a support ticket as a validated Pydantic model.

15:46.073 --> 15:48.192
and the customer query is this, the

