16:03.442 --> 16:05.601
And then before you return the response, you'll add one more field

16:06.412 --> 16:08.672
called creation_date which is just datetime.now().

16:08.672 --> 16:11.831
And this is just to demonstrate that you can populate the fields

16:11.831 --> 16:13.991
