16:18.662 --> 16:21.101
in your Pydantic data model before returning it.

16:21.351 --> 16:23.392
So let's define that. And now when

16:23.392 --> 16:26.182
you're ready to create a support ticket

16:26.631 --> 16:32.511
by passing in the customer_query, message from the previous LLM response, tool_outputs

16:32.511 --> 16:35.741
into your generate_structured_support_ticket function.

16:36.111 --> 16:39.481
And then you'll print that out. And so it worked.

16:39.481 --> 16:43.601
Now you have a valid instance of your support_ticket data model

16:43.601 --> 16:46.312
